   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Scribble Circle\n\nA hand-drawn marker circle scribbles itself around a target in stop-motion poses.\n\nCategory: paper. Length: 5 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A price, number or option should be circled by hand to direct attention to it.\n- A paper, scrapbook or stop-motion look is wanted.\n\nAvoid when:\n- You need a precise, geometric highlight ring.\n- The target moves: the circle is placed on a fixed spot.\n\nVariables:\n- plans (string): Rows, default \"[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Hobby\\\",\\\"price\\\":\\\"Free\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Pro\\\",\\\"price\\\":\\\"$19\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Team\\\",\\\"price\\\":\\\"$49\\\"}]\"\n- target (number, 0-9): Circled row, default 1\n- laps (number, 0.5-3): Laps, default 1.15\n- stroke_width (number, 2-30): Stroke width, default 14\n- pressure (number, 0.05-1): Opening pressure, default 0.2\n- grain (number, 0-2): Grain, default 1\n- duration_steps (number, 3-30): Drawing poses, default 10\n- color (color): Color, default \"#6f7f35\"\n- seed (string): Seed, default \"scribble\"\n- step (number, 1-6): Frames per pose, default 3\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
